<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Tier List Project</title>

<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  }

  body {
    background: #111827;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  header {
    background: #1f2937;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  header h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 0 1rem;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }

  nav a:hover {
    color: #60a5fa;
  }

  .container {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card {
    background: #1f2937;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    max-width: 850px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #d1d5db;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    color: #d1d5db;
    margin-left: 1rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    background: #2563eb;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: 0.3s;
  }

  .button:hover {
    background: #3b82f6;
  }

  .screenshot-section {
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .screenshot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .screenshot-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2px solid #374151;
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>Tier List Project</h1>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <div class="card">

    <h2>Project Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This Tier List project allows users to rank items from best to worst.
      It helps organize preferences visually in a simple interface.
    </p>

    <div class="screenshot-section">
      <h2>Screenshots</h2>

      <div class="screenshot-grid">
        <img src="images/tier1.png" alt="Tier List Screenshot 1">
        <img src="images/tier2.png" alt="Tier List Screenshot 2">
        <img src="images/tier3.png" alt="Tier List Screenshot 3">
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>My Role</h2>
    <p>
      I designed the layout and built the logic that allows users to organize and rank items.
    </p>

    <h2>Technologies Used</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>HTML</li>
      <li>CSS</li>
      <li>JavaScript</li>
    </ul>

    <a class="button" href="https://tier-list-eight.vercel.app/" target="_blank">
      View Live Project
    </a>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
